{"id":"contra_rio","lemma":"contrário","pos":"adj","rank":683,"glosses":["contrary, opposite","opposed, against"],"ipa":"/kõˈtɾa.ɾju/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-contr%C3%A1rio.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-contr%C3%A1rio.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"contrária","masculinePlural":"contrários","femininePlural":"contrárias"},"examples":[{"text":"Ele fez o contrário.","en":"He did the opposite.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1269533","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Não tenho nenhuma prova em contrário.","en":"I don't have any proof to the contrary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/841916","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},{"g":"not any, none","l":"nenhum"},{"g":"examination"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Pelo contrário, nunca disse tal coisa.","en":"On the contrary, I've never said such a thing.","words":[{"g":"by / for the","l":"pelar"},null,{"g":"never (at no time"},{"g":"to speak","l":"dizer"},{"g":"such-and-such"},{"g":"thing"}]},{"text":"Temos o problema contrário.","en":"We have the opposite problem.","words":[{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"problem"},null]},{"text":"Não é o contrário?","en":"Isn't it the other way around?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/485090","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"isn't it"]]}]}